# Copy to .env (which is gitignored) and fill in real values for local
# `docker compose up`. Dokploy injects its own env at deploy time.

# Server-side runtime config goes here (read by Node at boot, not baked into
# the bundle). VITE_* values are baked at `vite build` time and would need to
# move into Dockerfile ARGs to flow through.

# Example:
# LOG_LEVEL=info
